Z||000001||Formula88||10-26-2001||04:32 PM||||Well, any late 80's - early 90's GM FWD V6 (not Quad4) 5-speed has the same M282 Getrag, the exception being the 3.4DOHC that comes with the M284, but you aren't likely to find one.  Rodney Dickman has conversion kits to put the FWD tranny in a Fiero.  All external mods, you don't have to break the case open.  So check your salvage yards, etc.  If you can find a Fiero Getrag, great, but not required.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Slammed Fiero||10-26-2001||04:35 PM||||There is a Getrag 284 for sale in the eastern Ontario autotrader<P>this is the heavy unit out of the z34 Lumina.<P>the guy wants $1000<P>JM ||||reg||1
